OL,3,GNEWSAMum goes to Iceland as pilot of
OL,4,Adaughter's flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airline pilot had some special
OL,7,Fpassengers aboard her plane when she
OL,8,Fflew her daughter, classmates and
OL,9,Fteachers to Iceland for a school trip.
OL,11,FMarnie Munns, from Cambridge, captained
OL,12,Fthe Jet2 flight from Stansted Airport
OL,13,Fto Reykjavik with her 17-year-old
OL,14,Fdaughter Lillian and about 30 others
OL,15,Ffrom Framlingham College, Suffolk, on
OL,16,Fboard.
OL,18,FShe managed to swap a shift to make
OL,19,Fsure she could be in the cockpit for
OL,20,Fthe flight on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
