OL,3,GNEWSAMum goes to Iceland as pilot of
OL,4,Adaughter's flight
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It isn't every day you get to go to
OL,7,FIceland, and it certainly isn't every
OL,8,Fday your mum flies you there," said
OL,9,FLillian.
